//! The `object-position` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies
//! the alignment of the selected 's contents within the element's box. Areas of the box which aren't
//! covered by the replaced element's object will show the element's background.
//!
//! Initial: 50% 50%. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: refer to width and height of element itself.
//!
